Tool response:
Tool: cancel_recurring_gift
Description: Process the cancellation of a recurring gift by ID, log the cancellation reason, 
update the constituent's engagement score by -15 points, and perform a soft-delete 
on the recurring schedule while preserving historical records. Link the cancellation 
event to the original pledge.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The ID of the recurring gift to cancel",
          "title": "Id"
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Reason"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "reason"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: update_constituent_engagement_score
Description: Update the engagement score for a specified constituent by ID with the given change value.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The ID of the constituent",
          "title": "Id"
        },
        "change": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Change"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "change"
      ]
    }
